"# Conversion report

- Source: Bambu Studio (BambuStudio-02.08.04.57), printer "Bambu Lab X1 Carbon 0.4 nozzle"
- Target: Flashforge AD5X for Flash Studio (profiles OrcaSlicer v2.4.2)

## Warnings

- The author painted supports but had support generation off; supports were turned on so the painted areas print.
- 2 unused filament(s) were removed and the rest renumbered.

